Z||000000||sailordude||07-05-2001||05:58 PM||||Hey guys,<BR>   I just want to say that ever since I've bought my first fiero my drive to work and home everyday has become much more enjoyable.  Not only do I enjoy driving my car, but I also enjoy seeing all the other fieros on the road that I see everyday.  It's really cool to see that there are still many people out there that are using these great cars as daily drivers.  So for those of you who drive along I 94 between Port Huron and Detroit everyday, I just want to say Thank You for making my drive much more enjoyable.<P>Thanks again,<P>Darren||||reg||10
